	(text "PWR_FLAG: these rails reach their loads only through passive parts (USB-C, the fuse, the buck's inductor)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "54363ad9-519c-5c5b-993d-074579767510")
	)
	(text "Power tree: the Model I's edge carries no supply the card can use (pin 39 is +5V only on keyboard boards A-E,\nand Tandy warns against loading it), so the card runs from its USB-C alone.\n  VBUS -> F1, 1.1 A hold / 2.2 A trip resettable fuse -> +5V: the WS2812, the two regulators.\n  U14 AP2112K -> +3V3_RP: every RP2354B supply pin and every bus buffer (they come up together, fast).\n  U13 TLV62569 (2 A buck, 2.5-5.5 V in, 1.5 MHz) -> +3V3: the ESP32-S3, the CP2102N and the microSD;\n  VOUT = 0.6 V x (1 + R22 100k / R23 22k) = 3.33 V; 2.2 uH and 2 x 22 uF (datasheet Table 4).\nTP8, TP9, TP10 and TP11 are bring-up pads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 99.06 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "592e9aeb-8a36-5a6d-89b4-8c7c59167545")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
